      "id": "05-08",
      "title": "Settle B and improve D",
      "chapter": "Dijkstra worked example",
      "duration": 20.766666666666666,
      "narration": "B now has tentative distance three, smaller than the other unvisited entries. Its link to D costs five, so D improves from ten to eight. The route to D is now A, C, B, D. A finalized distance will not improve later under the nonnegative-cost assumption behind Dijkstra.",
